#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:2
msgid "Direct upload"
msgstr "直接上传"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:4
msgid ""
"Direct upload lets you build your documentation anywhere, for example in "
"GitHub Actions or in any other continuous integration service, and upload "
"the resulting files to Read the Docs for hosting. This guide shows how to "
"build your documentation in your own pipeline and upload it."
msgstr ""
"直接上传让你可以在任何地方构建文档（例如在 GitHub Actions 或任何其他持续集成服务中），并将生成的文件上传到 Read the Docs "
"进行托管。本指南展示如何在自己的流水线中构建文档并上传。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:9
msgid ""
"Documentation uploaded this way keeps all the hosting features you already "
"know: :doc:`versions </versions>`, :doc:`pull request previews </pull-"
"requests>`, :doc:`server side search </server-side-search/index>`, "
":doc:`Addons </addons>`, :doc:`custom domains </custom-domains>` and "
":doc:`downloadable formats </offline-formats>`, among others."
msgstr ""
"这样上传的文档保留了你已知的所有托管功能：:doc:`版本 </versions>`、:doc:`Pull Request 预览 </pull-"
"requests>`、:doc:`服务器端搜索 </server-side-search/index>`、:doc:`Addon "
"</addons>`、:doc:`自定义域名 </custom-domains>` 和 :doc:`可下载格式 </offline-formats>` "
"等。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:15
msgid "Direct upload is useful when:"
msgstr "直接上传在以下情况下很有用："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:17
msgid "Your documentation tool is not supported by the Read the Docs build process."
msgstr "你的文档工具不受 Read the Docs 构建过程支持。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:18
msgid ""
"Your build needs tools, secrets or resources that are only available in your"
" own environment."
msgstr "你的构建需要仅在你自己环境中可用的工具、机密或资源。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:19
msgid ""
"You already build the documentation in your continuous integration pipeline "
"and want to reuse the result."
msgstr "你已在持续集成流水线中构建文档，想复用结果。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Direct upload is currently a beta feature.** We'd love to hear your "
"feedback on it."
msgstr "**直接上传目前是 Beta 功能。** 我们非常期待你的反馈。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:26
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:28
msgid ""
"A project on Read the Docs that uses direct upload. When :doc:`adding your "
"project </intro/add-project>`, choose :guilabel:`Build externally and "
"upload` in the configuration step. To enable direct upload on an existing "
"project, :doc:`contact support </support>`."
msgstr ""
"一个使用直接上传的 Read the Docs 项目。:doc:`添加项目 </intro/add-project>` 时，在配置步骤选择 "
":guilabel:`Build externally and upload`。要在现有项目上启用直接上传，请 :doc:`联系支持 "
"</support>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:32
msgid ""
"An API token for your project. Store it as a secret in your continuous "
"integration service."
msgstr "项目的 API 令牌。将其作为机密存储在你的持续集成服务中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:35
msgid "To create an API token for your project:"
msgstr "为项目创建 API 令牌："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:37
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> API tokens`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> API tokens`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:38
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add API token`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add API token`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:39
msgid ""
"Choose a name, the :guilabel:`Upload documentation` permission, and when the"
" token expires."
msgstr "选择名称、:guilabel:`Upload documentation` 权限和令牌过期时间。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:40
msgid "Copy the token. It's only shown once."
msgstr "复制令牌。它只显示一次。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:42
msgid ""
"A project API token only gives access to your project, and lets you leave "
"out the project slug when uploading, since the token already identifies the "
"project. You can also use your personal :ref:`API token <api/v3:Token>`, but"
" it gives access to everything your user has access to. On |com_brand|, a "
"personal API token also requires :ref:`setting the API URL <guides/build"
"/direct-upload:Read the Docs Business>`."
msgstr ""
"项目 API 令牌仅授予对你项目的访问权限，上传时可省略项目 slug，因为令牌已标识项目。你也可以使用个人 :ref:`API 令牌 "
"<api/v3:Token>`，但它能访问你用户有权访问的所有内容。在 |com_brand| 上，个人 API 令牌还需要 :ref:`设置 API "
"URL <guides/build/direct-upload:Read the Docs Business>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:50
msgid "Uploading from GitHub Actions"
msgstr "从 GitHub Actions 上传"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:52
msgid ""
"Use the `upload action <https://github.com/readthedocs/upload-action>`__ "
"after the step that builds your documentation:"
msgstr "在构建文档的步骤后使用 `upload action <https://github.com/readthedocs/upload-action>`__："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:55
msgid ".github/workflows/docs.yaml"
msgstr ".github/workflows/docs.yaml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:97
msgid ""
"The workflow reads the API token from a secret named ``READTHEDOCS_TOKEN``. "
"Add it to your repository under :menuselection:`Settings --> Secrets and "
"variables --> Actions`, or follow `GitHub's guide on using secrets "
"<https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/security-"
"guides/using-secrets-in-github-actions>`__."
msgstr ""
"工作流从名为 ``READTHEDOCS_TOKEN`` 的 secret 读取 API 令牌。将其添加到仓库的 "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Secrets and variables --> Actions` 下，或遵循 "
"`GitHub 关于使用 secrets 的指南 <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-"
"github-actions/security-guides/using-secrets-in-github-actions>`__。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:101
msgid ""
"The upload action detects the branch, tag or pull request from the workflow "
"event, so a push to ``main`` updates the ``main`` version, a new tag creates"
" a new version, and a pull request creates a :doc:`pull request preview "
"</pull-requests>`. See :ref:`guides/build/direct-upload:Versions` for how "
"uploaded versions behave."
msgstr ""
"上传 action 从工作流事件中检测分支、标签或 Pull Request，因此推送到 ``main`` 会更新 ``main`` "
"版本，新标签会创建新版本，Pull Request 会创建 :doc:`Pull Request 预览 </pull-"
"requests>`。上传版本的行为请参阅 :ref:`guides/build/direct-upload:Versions`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:107
msgid ""
"The ``paths`` filters make the workflow run only when the documentation or "
"its dependencies change. Adjust them to match your repository layout, or "
"remove them to upload on every push and pull request."
msgstr "``paths`` 过滤器使工作流仅在文档或其依赖变更时运行。根据你的仓库布局调整，或移除它们以在每次推送和 Pull Request 时上传。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:111
msgid ""
"The example pins the third-party actions to a commit hash, as GitHub "
"recommends. Do the same for the upload action by replacing ``@v1`` with the "
"full commit hash of a release, as described in the `action's README "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/upload-action#versioning>`__."
msgstr ""
"示例将第三方 action 固定到提交哈希，这是 GitHub 推荐的做法。请对上传 action 做同样的处理，将 ``@v1`` "
"替换为某个发布的完整提交哈希，详见 `action 的 README <https://github.com/readthedocs/upload-"
"action#versioning>`__。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:117
msgid "Uploading from any other environment"
msgstr "从任何其他环境上传"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:119
msgid ""
"The upload action is a thin wrapper around the `readthedocs-upload "
"<https://pypi.org/project/readthedocs-upload/>`__ package, a command line "
"client that you can run from any continuous integration service or from your"
" own computer. It requires Python 3.10 or newer and reads the token from the"
" ``READTHEDOCS_TOKEN`` environment variable:"
msgstr ""
"上传 action 是 `readthedocs-upload <https://pypi.org/project/readthedocs-"
"upload/>`__ 包的薄封装，这是一个命令行客户端，可在任何持续集成服务或你自己的电脑上运行。它需要 Python 3.10 或更新版本，并从 "
"``READTHEDOCS_TOKEN`` 环境变量读取令牌："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:130
msgid ""
"You can also install it with ``pip install readthedocs-upload``, which makes"
" the ``readthedocs`` command available."
msgstr "也可用 ``pip install readthedocs-upload`` 安装，这会提供 ``readthedocs`` 命令。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:133
msgid ""
"Outside GitHub Actions, the client infers the version from the local Git "
"checkout. On other continuous integration services, pass the version "
"explicitly:"
msgstr "在 GitHub Actions 之外，客户端从本地 Git 检出推断版本。在其他持续集成服务上，显式传递版本："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:145
msgid "Run ``readthedocs upload --help`` to see all the options."
msgstr "运行 ``readthedocs upload --help`` 查看所有选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:148
msgid "Uploading offline formats"
msgstr "上传离线格式"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:150
msgid ""
"PDF, ePub and zipped HTML files are optional, and each one points to a "
"single file. They are shown in the :term:`flyout menu` like any other "
":doc:`downloadable format </offline-formats>`:"
msgstr ""
"PDF、ePub 和压缩 HTML 文件是可选的，每个指向单个文件。它们像其他 :doc:`可下载格式 </offline-formats>` "
"一样显示在 :term:`flyout menu` 中："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:174
msgid "Read the Docs Business"
msgstr "Read the Docs Business"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:176
msgid ""
"Direct upload works the same way on |com_brand|. Project API tokens identify"
" the platform they belong to, so the upload action and the command line "
"client send your upload to |com_brand| without any extra configuration."
msgstr ""
"直接上传在 |com_brand| 上工作方式相同。项目 API 令牌标识其所属平台，因此上传 action 和命令行客户端无需额外配置即可将上传发送到"
" |com_brand|。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:180
msgid ""
"If you use your personal API token instead, set the API URL to "
"``https://app.readthedocs.com``:"
msgstr "如果你改用个人 API 令牌，请将 API URL 设为 ``https://app.readthedocs.com``："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:200
msgid ""
"The command line client also reads the API URL from the "
"``READTHEDOCS_API_URL`` environment variable."
msgstr "命令行客户端也从 ``READTHEDOCS_API_URL`` 环境变量读取 API URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:203
msgid "Privacy levels"
msgstr "隐私级别"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:205
msgid ""
"Uploaded versions are private by default. To publish a public version, set "
"the :doc:`privacy level </commercial/privacy-level>` when uploading:"
msgstr "上传的版本默认为私有。上传时设置 :doc:`隐私级别 </commercial/privacy-level>` 以发布公开版本："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:226
msgid ""
"Every upload sets the privacy level of the version, so an upload without it "
"makes the version private again, even if you made it public from the version"
" settings. Set the privacy level on every upload of a public version."
msgstr "每次上传都设置版本的隐私级别，因此没有隐私级别的上传会让版本再次变为私有，即使你在版本设置中将其设为公开。每次上传公开版本时都要设置隐私级别。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:232
msgid "Versions"
msgstr "版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:234
msgid ""
"Uploaded versions behave differently depending on whether the project is "
"built by Read the Docs or not."
msgstr "上传版本的行为取决于项目是否由 Read the Docs 构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:237
msgid "Projects that only use direct upload"
msgstr "仅使用直接上传的项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:239
msgid ""
"On a project that only uses direct upload, every version comes from an "
"upload, and the name you upload is the version you get: uploading ``main`` "
"publishes ``main``, uploading ``v1.0`` publishes ``v1.0``. Read the Docs "
"does not create versions from your repository, and it does not create the "
"``latest`` and ``stable`` aliases."
msgstr ""
"在仅使用直接上传的项目上，每个版本来自上传，你上传的名称即为所得版本：上传 ``main`` 发布 ``main``，上传 ``v1.0`` 发布 "
"``v1.0``。Read the Docs 不会从你的仓库创建版本，也不会创建 ``latest`` 和 ``stable`` 别名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:244
msgid "Default version"
msgstr "默认版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:245
msgid ""
"The first branch or tag you upload becomes the :term:`default version`, so "
"the root of your documentation works right away. Pull request previews never"
" become the default."
msgstr "你上传的第一个分支或标签成为 :term:`default version`，因此文档根路径立即可用。Pull Request 预览永远不会成为默认版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:249
msgid "``latest`` and ``stable``"
msgstr "``latest`` 和 ``stable``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:250
msgid ""
"If you want these names, upload them from your pipeline. For example, to "
"publish ``stable`` from every tag in addition to the tag itself, add a "
"second upload step that only runs on tags:"
msgstr "如果你需要这些名称，请从流水线上传。例如，要在每个标签之外也发布 ``stable``，请添加一个仅在标签上运行的第二个上传步骤："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:264
msgid "Deactivating a version"
msgstr "停用版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:265
msgid ""
"Deactivating an uploaded version deletes it, together with its "
"documentation. Upload it again to publish it again."
msgstr "停用上传的版本会连同其文档一起删除。再次上传即可重新发布。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:268
msgid "Automation rules"
msgstr "自动化规则"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:269
msgid ""
":doc:`Automation rules </automation-rules>` do not run on projects that only"
" use direct upload. Hide, activate or set the default version from the "
"project settings, or from your pipeline through the :doc:`API </api/v3>`. On"
" a project built by Read the Docs, uploading a version runs the automation "
"rules as usual."
msgstr ""
":doc:`自动化规则 </automation-rules>` 不在仅使用直接上传的项目上运行。从项目设置或通过 :doc:`API "
"</api/v3>` 从流水线隐藏、激活或设置默认版本。在 Read the Docs 构建的项目上，上传版本会按常规运行自动化规则。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:275
msgid "Projects built by Read the Docs"
msgstr "由 Read the Docs 构建的项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:277
msgid ""
"On a project that Read the Docs builds from your repository, you can upload "
"any single version while the rest of the project keeps being built as "
"before."
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 从你的仓库构建的项目上，你可以上传任意单个版本，其余项目保持原有构建方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:280
msgid ""
"The version doesn't need to exist before the first upload. A branch, tag or "
"pull request that Read the Docs doesn't know yet is created by the upload. "
"Uploading the branch that ``latest`` tracks updates ``latest`` version."
msgstr ""
"版本在首次上传前无需存在。Read the Docs 尚不知的分支、标签或 Pull Request 会由上传创建。上传 ``latest`` "
"跟踪的分支会更新 ``latest`` 版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:284
msgid ""
"Once a version has been uploaded, Read the Docs stops building it. Pushes to"
" the branch, new commits on the pull request and manual builds don't trigger"
" anything for that version, so every later update has to come through an "
"upload as well."
msgstr ""
"一旦版本被上传，Read the Docs 就停止构建它。推送到分支、Pull Request "
"上的新提交和手动构建都不会为该版本触发任何操作，因此后续每次更新都必须通过上传。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:288
msgid ""
"To have Read the Docs build an uploaded version again, uncheck "
":guilabel:`Uploaded` in the version settings. The uploaded files are "
"removed, a build is triggered, and the version is available again when that "
"build succeeds."
msgstr ""
"要让 Read the Docs 重新构建已上传的版本，请在版本设置中取消勾选 "
":guilabel:`Uploaded`。上传的文件会被移除，触发一次构建，构建成功后该版本重新可用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:294
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:296
msgid "The uploaded archive can be up to 1 GB."
msgstr "上传的压缩包最大 1 GB。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:297
msgid "The upload has to complete within 30 minutes of starting it."
msgstr "上传必须在开始后 30 分钟内完成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:298
msgid "A project can have at most 50 uploads in progress at the same time."
msgstr "一个项目最多同时有 50 个进行中的上传。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:302
msgid ":doc:`/builds`"
msgstr ":doc:`/builds`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/build/direct-upload.rst:303
msgid "How Read the Docs builds documentation when you don't use direct upload."
msgstr "不使用直接上传时，Read the Docs 如何构建文档。"

